<title>UK: UK's FTSE surges one percent as budget fears wane.</title>
<headline>UK's FTSE surges one percent as budget fears wane.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's FTSE 100 share index raced ahead on Wednesday as fears over the UK budget waned, dealers said.</p>
<p>The index was 54 points 0r 1.14 percent higher at 4,782.3 by 0812 GMT, just short of its all-time high of 4,796, hit on June 13.</p>
